          Browse all <a href="/recipes" class="text-brand hover:underline font-medium">recipes</a>, or wire results to your stack with <a href="/webhooks" class="text-brand hover:underline font-medium">webhooks</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 border-b border-ink-200 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
            FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-950">
            Automation questions
